   "section": "Exterior",
   "text": "There are minor misc of scratches around the vehicle. The hood has some scratches as well. The vehicle shows miscellaneous dings around the body. There is a dent on the top of the roof that is kinda hard to see, but there a dent found by the drivers side, see image. The exterior was dirty at the time of the inspection which can hide any minor imperfections. The underside shows areas of surface rust. The headlights are worn and foggy due to oxidation. Interior There is wear to the seats. The inner door panels show wear. The interior trim shows wear. Mechanical The engines valve cover shows seeping some oil. There were no drips at time of inspection. This area should be cleaned off and rechecked to verify source of leak or leaks. The exhaust shows some surface rust throughout, but at this time has no leaks and sounds good. All of the tires are low on treads and there is something stuck in the left rear tire. All of the wheels show some curb rash and scratches. Road Test Complete The engine feels like it has a shake or misfire while driving and further diagnostics is needed. I scanned the vehicle and there are codes in the system, see images."
